  3: ["False: aqueous humour is secreted by the ciliary processes into the **posterior** chamber, then flows through the pupil to the anterior chamber.", "a: True: the fovea lies on the visual axis.", "c: True: light reflexly activates the parasympathetic supply to the sphincter pupillae.", "d: True: the cornea gives about two-thirds of the eye's power."],
